Copied unmodified from SDL, tag release-3.4.16:
https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/tree/release-3.4.16

The files keep SDL's layout, because rename_symbols.py reads
include/SDL3/SDL_oldnames.h relative to its own location. They are
zlib-licensed; see LICENSE.txt.

CI checks that each file listed below is byte-identical to the same path
in the SDL release archive, and that nothing else is in this folder.

Files:
build-scripts/rename_headers.py
build-scripts/rename_macros.py
build-scripts/rename_symbols.py
docs/README-migration.md
include/SDL3/SDL_oldnames.h
LICENSE.txt

To update: copy the same paths from a newer SDL release, change the tag
here and in CMakeLists.txt, and record the decision in ROADMAP.md.
